<title>UK: Littlewoods  profits up 15 pct in year.</title>
<headline>Littlewoods  profits up 15 pct in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's largest private company Littlewoods  on Tuesday said pretax profits rose 15.2 percent to 112.1 million stg in the 12 months to December 31 1996.</p>
<p>Sales totalled 2.28 billion stg, down from 2.31 billion in the previous year. Turnover at the group's retail division fell 27.3 percent to 459 million stg from 631 million.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom + 44 171 542 7717</p>
